  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Collaborative Investigation and Revitalization of the Traditional Rebana Kercing Drum Performance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this project, the Universiti Malaysia Kelantan is teaming up with ECA exchange alumni in the arts and the YSEALI network to preserve the endangered Rebana Kercing traditional drum performance. Support for this project comes from the AFCP 20th Anniversary Partnership Program, a State Department special initiative.</narrative>
